## 8. V2 compatibility (the next pencil-in)

Shape the fan-out so the V2 grid (variants × samples) is **the variant roll
composed with a sample fan-out inside each variant shard**: the sample fan-out
state of §6 becomes the inner loop of the existing variant roll. Keeping
`shard_by` + `shard_samples` mutually exclusive in v1 (with an error naming the
follow-on) reserves the combined syntax for V2 without committing to it now.

